  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards an open, fair and sustainable Europe in the world - Third Trio EU Presidency Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective is to contribute to increased public and political support for EU&#xbf;s international partnerships in order to reach the 2030 Agenda and rebuild better, greener, and in a more equal, gender transformative, way. The specific objectives are: 1.Public and political awareness of EU&#xbf;s role as a global actor in international partnerships has increased; 2.Civil society is better equipped to engage in EU-related advocacy and awareness raising around the EU&apos;s role as global actor in international partnerships; and 3.Efforts to contribute to sufficient, effective and coherent international partnerships have been made, in Member States and at the EU level.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
